<title>USA: Salomon names Kavanagh managing director.</title>
<headline>Salomon names Kavanagh managing director.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers, a unit of Salomon Inc, said on Thursday that Ann Kavanagh has joined the firm as managing director in the Equity Capital Markets/Syndicate department.</p>
<p>Kavanagh was previously president and chief executive officer of National Westminster Bank Plc affiliate NatWest Securities Corp USA, where she was responsible for directing equity sales, trading and research in the U.S.</p>
